# Evaluation bench of the paper (paper/eval): the raw data identify the
# workstation (host and user names, paths) and stay local; the tables and
# numbers derived from them are published. results/*/episodes/ is the
# superseded single-run layout of the first version of the bench.
/paper/eval/results/*/scans/
/paper/eval/results/*/runs/*/scans/
/paper/eval/results/archive-*/*/runs/*/scans/
/paper/eval/results/*/episodes/
/paper/eval/results/*/insitu.json
/paper/eval/results/inventory.json
/paper/eval/results/*.log
/paper/eval/results/*/dns-ttl-scans/
/paper/eval/results/*/intermittent-scans/
__pycache__/
